; ============================================================
; Mandel-v08  —  Mandelbrot 40x24, POLISHED
;                (loads at $4000, VM1)
; ============================================================
; Same fractal as v07 (verified), plus:
;   - a title banner "STELLAR MANDELBROT" printed first (inline
;     LOADAI+SEROUT per char -- all verified opcodes, no loop)
;   - a refined 16-level character ramp for smoother shading
;
; Main body is byte-identical to v07, relocated below the banner;
; addresses + BD call targets were recomputed by a small assembler
; (scratchpad/asm), so no hand-addressing. Grid 40x24, x[-2.5,1.0],
; y[-1.2,1.2]. Subs: SMUL @ $0185  SADD @ $019E.
; Ramp @ $0900 (light->dark): ' .:-=+coa*x%#&W@'
; Prints banner, then the fractal row by row (~10+ min).
; D-lines are a clean block (Elf2K loader).
; ============================================================

